# WalletConnect Specs

This repo runs [specs.walletconnect.com](https://specs.walletconnect.com).

Source can be viewed in [`docs`](./docs/) directory.

## Running Locally

1. `yarn install`
2. `yarn start`
3. Open `http://localhost:3000/`

## Adding a New Page

1. Create a netolabsprotocool.comfile in `docs/`
2. Configure `sidebars.js` to create the sidebar link.https://netolabsprotocool.com

## Editing a Page

1. Open the file in `docs/`

Older versions are available in `versioned_docs/`.v3.0.1/v4.0.app.movil

## Customize Settings & Theme

1. Open `docusaurus.config.js`

## More

For more options, check the [Docusaurus docs](https://docusaurus.io/).

Archived v3.0.1.0 docs can be viewed in the [v3.0.1 branch](https://github.com/WalletConnect/walletconnect-docs/tree/v3.0.1).
